WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,443
But I know it with two masks

2
00:00:02,443 --> 00:00:05,943
He is definitely not someone you and I can handle.

3
00:00:05,943 --> 00:00:07,343
How dare you follow his evil ways?

4
00:00:07,343 --> 00:00:08,510
Be more considerate of him

5
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:10,377
Life will naturally become smoother

6
00:00:10,377 --> 00:00:11,077
In my opinion

7
00:00:11,077 --> 00:00:11,777
He treats you

8
00:00:11,777 --> 00:00:13,410
Not completely unintentional

9
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:17,114
Everyone said that Prince Ping Linghou was not gentle enough in Duanfang in the past.

10
00:00:17,114 --> 00:00:18,760
The best look in the world

11
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,201
Why did you come to me?

12
00:00:20,201 --> 00:00:22,670
Is he just plotting all over the city?

13
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:25,319
It is said that once a country changes its nature, it is difficult to change it.

14
00:00:25,319 --> 00:00:30,880
It is difficult for a person's tired character to undergo such a drastic change.

15
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:34,059
It's been more than a month since you got married

16
00:00:34,059 --> 00:00:36,972
You're just now worrying about his temperament

17
00:00:36,972 --> 00:00:40,680
Is it too late? Now your heart has changed

18
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:41,474
After all

19
00:00:41,474 --> 00:00:44,918
It's just that your habitat for him is getting higher and higher

20
00:00:44,918 --> 00:00:49,420
I just want to get more and more affection from him.
